# The submission image only COPYs src/, data/maps, data/racelines and
# submission/. Everything else is build context sent to the daemon for nothing —
# .venv/ and upstream/ alone are ~1.8 GB, which makes every image build slow and
# risks baking host-only artefacts into a competition submission.
.venv/
upstream/
.git/
data/bags/
data/logs/
data/screens/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
install/
log/
